<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-23T13:39:58.758Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:39:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed an NDC supporter in Enugu and bandits in Kaduna continue to hold a widow, her son and a newborn captive three weeks after a kidnapping. In Plateau, an abducted pastor was found dead and four others were killed in fresh attacks, while suspected herders attacked a Benue community, killing three and injuring others. Senate leaders are demanding a security overhaul and seeking troop deployment after 113 people were killed in Benue, and electricity workers withdrew services in Makurdi after an alleged attack. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPdDZORDh0Y0V5N1dWRnl0NVlFSGktX2JvZWt2S0VKUWk0MkV1Y0dWUXp4M016QkJLWmRFS0Q4N3hpcWpNRlpQTDFJMDZhaG85RENJQlZTd1piQU40ZkhJQ1dLR2pZdEloVnluY1k2QnhERzFyZ1VPc0NfVVNTektuQnlYdTdjeE9f?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOMFk0enRkelZfRmk3UmpqYlg5Z1RSaHpWbVVjSFBFVFg1enh1alBoRHFDTlI5RG5vVFNjZHZjQUJyZFEyeXBYdjJGTDRZTHg3X3BncExiSUFJT1ZNYWY3UUhPX2t5WXVVRFlwZHRaaEZKbUpSUnlZSk5WTkNxZGt0eTV6Q3Z4ZWFqdS1jZWF0ZEpia0ctLTRuY0UyTlZzSkN4UHByVl93bVdGaUxTd1lQOU1vZTcyTUpKa1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPVXItNmFOcy1xTnAzMnJzNXpXQ193ZWZSWGp4U0tPVGd4Slc5aS02Zk5EYUtTbmJRemNqczhVdEdzTzYtQndLWEVHaUZjTHhZZFA5alFhZV9aX3NZdE1LcTBIb2huR1JWWnlPX3JGdDltZTAxODlGZ012T0doQmlZQlBoWFFIMTl1d3dVRElCQVNmMXpqeXRDRkNoZEEyaFJrZUlEWWFkUklXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTFAzemFaaDBhaEpRZk1KTHZFUGdhQmpMZDY4ekhHcVBneGdBeThQZEMzdGJxT0FXVnF5WURyMGh4UVJUckNpQ0hCS21qNW1FMnplSFdaSzFGY0R5eTA5Qzk3clVieU4tSmZoX1JlcQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Naija News&lt;/a&gt;,